### Pengujian REST Client (ekstensi VS Code "REST Client" oleh Huachao Mao)
### Klik "Send Request" di atas tiap blok. Jalankan server dulu: npm run start:dev

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### 1. GET semua hewan
GET {{baseUrl}}/pets

### 2. GET dengan filter jenis dan pencarian
GET {{baseUrl}}/pets?jenis=kucing&q=tenang

### 3. GET satu hewan
GET {{baseUrl}}/pets/1

### 4. POST tambah hewan (payload persis seperti PetForm: nama, jenis, umur)
POST {{baseUrl}}/pets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nama": "Mochi",
  "jenis": "Kucing",
  "umur": 5
}

### 5. POST dengan field lengkap
POST {{baseUrl}}/pets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nama": "Choco",
  "jenis": "Anjing",
  "ras": "Pomeranian",
  "jenisKelamin": "Jantan",
  "umur": 9,
  "lokasi": "Haven Hill Haven",
  "deskripsi": "Aktif dan sangat suka bermain bola.",
  "sifat": ["Aktif & Lincah", "Vaksin Penuh"],
  "sudahSteril": true,
  "status": "Siap Dijemput",
  "tanggalMasuk": "2026-11-20"
}

### 6. PATCH ubah sebagian data
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/pets/9
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "umur": 6,
  "status": "Dalam Proses"
}

### 7. DELETE hapus hewan
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/pets/9

### ---------- Skenario error ----------

### E1. 400 Bad Request: validasi DTO gagal
POST {{baseUrl}}/pets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nama": "A",
  "jenis": "",
  "umur": -3,
  "status": "Hilang"
}

### E2. 404 Not Found: id tidak ada
GET {{baseUrl}}/pets/9999

### E3. 409 Conflict: data duplikat (Milo sudah ada)
POST {{baseUrl}}/pets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nama": "Milo",
  "jenis": "Kucing",
  "ras": "Tabby Orange Domestik",
  "umur": 18
}

### E4. 400 Bad Request: id bukan angka
GET {{baseUrl}}/pets/abc
